      "title": "[P1] Prefer the new capability over an unresolved host ID",
      "body": "When a reused iframe receives a capability-only result for the next card while the previous card's ID restore is still pending, `displayedDataFingerprint.current` is null, so this predicate leaves the old `toolCallId` attached. `restoreSnapshot` then sends the old ID with the new capability; the server's ID-first lookup returns the previous card, and a subsequent save can bind or expire the new snapshot under that ID. Restore by capability alone until the host identity is correlated.",
