        "line_range": {
          "start": 676,
          "end": 681
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "[P2] Keep delayed widget echoes from reviving cleared cards",
      "body": "When `toolOutput: null` explicitly clears a card and a previously queued `setWidgetState` echo arrives afterward, the clear path has set both `hasLiveToolOutput` and `hasAuthoritativeResultData` to false. This condition therefore accepts the widget-only snapshot and repopulates the stale card, undoing the explicit clear; the same can happen after a completed `found:false` restore. Preserve an authoritative absent/cleared marker in this gate so delayed cache echoes remain ignored.",
      "confidence_score": 0.99,
      "priority": 2,
      "code_location": {
        "absolute_file_path": "/Users/burakemre/Code/lobu/.claude/worktrees/mcp-app-v8/packages/owletto/src/mcp-apps/_shared/host.tsx",
